Inspire Go SDK is an independent implementation for the SII computing platform.

The native Inspire JSON contract and test cases use interface information from
realZillionX/InspireSkill (MIT), commit
06e881ff1c52af91dc4ccb8f29581d0ff4895b58. Contract fixtures are maintained in
src/tests/testdata/contracts.json.

Third-party dependency licenses are included under third_party/licenses.
